                <div class="postingContent">
                    <span id="lblSpecialRequirementText"><p style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span>If mailing in an application, include </span><span style="color: #0000ff; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;">JC#467891</span><span>&nbsp;on your State Application (STD678) in the &quot;Examination(s) or Job Title(s) for which you are applying&quot; section found under the </span><span style="font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;">“Questions” </span><span style="font-style: italic;">tab of your CalCareer application template</span><span>. </span><span style="font-weight: bold;">Applicants who do not submit the required information may not be considered for this job.</span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;">Employment Application (STD.678):</span></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial;">It is a requirement to submit work experience, dates, and hours worked, contact names and phone numbers of supervisors on the state application in order of current and old work experience. Resumes or other documents cannot substitute a state application. Applicants who fail to submit a completed STD.678 may not be considered.<br /></span></span></p><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span lang="EN"><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong style="text-decoration-line: underline;">Statement of Qualifications:<br style="text-decoration-line: underline;" /></strong></span></span></span><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">In addition to a correctly completed and submitted State Application (STD 678) a Statement of Qualifications (SOQ) is required in order to be considered for an interview. The SOQ should address how the candidate’s experience meets each of the following desirable qualifications. Each response must be numbered and should provide specific examples of how the candidate meets the qualification. The SOQ must be </span><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">no more than two (2) pages typed in Arial 14-point font, with 1-inch margins</span><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">. Successful candidates will incorporate and demonstrate a commitment to the mission of the Department of Rehabilitation in their Statement of Qualifications.<br /> </span></p><ol start="1" style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;">
			<li style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">Please describe how your education and or past work experience makes you the best qualified candidate for the Business Specialist position.</li></ol>
		<p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p><ol start="2" style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;">
			<li style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">Please describe your experience working with individuals with disabilities.</li></ol>
		<p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p><ol start="3" style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;">
			<li style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">Please describe how you have demonstrated good leadership and provide at least one example. &nbsp;</li></ol>
		<p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p><ol start="4" style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;">
			<li style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">Please describe your work experience demonstrating effective communication skills with multiple stakeholders.</li></ol><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"><br />SSA-BSs:</span></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial;">Up to 40% fieldwork and travel within the district.</span></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;">ALL SSAs-5157:</span></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial;">Upon hire, applicant may be required to provide copies of transcripts or diploma.</span></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial;"> </span></span></p></span>
                </div>
            
</div>

