mily: Arial; font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://www.calhr.ca.gov/employees/Pages/basic-group-term-life-insurance-for-excluded-employees.aspx" style="text-decoration: none;"><span style="color: #0000ff; text-decoration: underline;">Life Insurance</span></a></li><li style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://www.calhr.ca.gov/employees/Pages/ScholarShare-529-College-Savings-Plan.aspx" style="text-decoration: none;"><span style="color: #0000ff; text-decoration: underline;">ScholarShare</span></a> (College Saving Account)</li><li style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://www.calhr.ca.gov/employees/Pages/pre-tax-parking-reimbursement-account-program-.aspx" style="text-decoration: none;"><span style="color: #0000ff; text-decoration: underline;">Pre-Tax Parking</span></a></li></ul>
